  "description": "ZIJTOD crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H108 N28 Nd8 O60. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd5 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd6 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd7 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd8 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.877-3.944 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.61-112.30°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd8(sao)4(μ3-OH)4(NO3)12(DMF)12]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 12 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
